color:var(--muted);max-width:68ch;margin:6px 0 0}\n.eyebrow{font:600 12px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n.summary{display:grid;gap:10px}\n.tbl{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel)}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:560px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\nth,td{padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}\nth{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}\ntr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}\n.chip{display:inline-block;min-width:2.6em;text-align:center;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;border:1.5px solid currentColor}\n.c-ok{color:var(--ok)} .c-warn{color:var(--warn)} .c-bad{color:var(--bad)}\n.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:80ch;margin:0}\nsection.screen{display:grid;gap:12px;padding-top:22px;border-top:2px solid var(--line)}\n.head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:8px 16px}\n.num{font-family:var(--display);color:var(--gold);font-size:22px;font-weight:800}\n.facts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px;font-size:14px}\n.facts b{font-weight:600}\n.verdict{display:grid;gap:6px;max-width:80ch}\n.verdict p{margin:0}\n.lbl{font-weight:600}\n.status{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan)}\n.strip{display:flex;gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding-bottom:8px;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}\nfigure{margin:0;flex:0 0 min(78vw,360px);scroll-snap-align:start;display:grid;gap:6px}\nfigure a{display:block;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}\nfigure a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:2px}\nfigure img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:9/16;max-width:100%}\nfigcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\nfigcaption b{color:var(--fg);font-weight:600}\n.fix{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;display:grid;gap:10px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<header>\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\">Rainbow · playable screens 04–08 · 17 Nov 2026</div>\n  <h1>Visual audit while Benny swims</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">Each screen's newest version, compared with your approved image at the approved camera and while moving\n  forward, steering and later in the screen. Swipe each row; tap a picture to open it full size. Nothing here is approved —\n  only you approve.</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"summary\">\n  <div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n    <thead><tr><th>Screen</th><th>Approved view<br>(my rating)</th><th>While riding<br>(my rating)</th><th>Whole-frame match<br>at approved view</th><th>Colour match<br>while moving</th><th>Normal game today</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>04 Through the Five Arrows</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">4</span></td><td>81.8 %</td><td>67.9 %</td><td>6.4 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>05 Flow Into the Current</td><td><span class=\"chip c-ok\">8.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">6</span></td><td>89.4 %</td><td>79.3 %</td><td>18.5 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>06 Crest the Rinse Arch</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">3</span></td><td>79.1 %</td><td>67.7 %</td><td>5.0 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>07 Dive the Washer Tube</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">3.5</span></td><td>80.1 %</td><td>65.6 %</td><td>6.7 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>08 Final Spin Chamber</td><td><span class=\"chip c-ok\">8.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7</span></td><td>84.1 %</td><td>76.2 %</td><td>4.0 %</td></tr>\n    </tbody></table></div>\n  <p class=\"note\"><b>No screen reaches your 8.5/10 target while riding yet.</b> Ratings are my visual judgement. \"Whole-frame match\" =\n  share of pixels within 20 colour levels of your image (includes Benny and the top bar). \"Colour match while moving\" = how\n  much of your image's colour palette survives in 11 moving frames (your approved view scores 91–96 %; the normal game\n  42–59 %). Neither number proves a moving 3D scene looks identical.</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s08\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">08</span><h2 id=\"s08\">Final Spin Chamber</h2><span class=\"status\">Specialist working now</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 8.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 7</span><span><b>Match</b> 84.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> the chamber holds up well while swimming forward. Gold arch slivers slide in at the edges when steering, and steering hard puts Benny on the purple floor beside the painted river (it also costs a heart near the end).</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> chamber surfaces your painting never showed, and river texture only on the painted S-curve instead of under the whole swim lane.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">These frames are missing the ceiling fix from last round: its code had been dropped from the saved branch by an autosave and was restored this round from history.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 08\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s06\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><h2 id=\"s06\">Crest the Rinse Arch</h2><span class=\"status\">Specialist working now · your major priority</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 7.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 3</span><span><b>Match</b> 79.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> from 3 units forward a huge flat wall of repeated pink-chevron water fills most of the screen; the curved tunnel survives only above a hard horizontal edge.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> the fitted river surface is much wider than your painted river and rises as a hump. From the approved camera it carries your painted tunnel walls, so it looks right; once Benny moves, those wall areas switch to one repeated, mirrored water tile.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 06\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s07\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">07</span><h2 id=\"s07\">Dive the Washer Tube</h2><span class=\"status\">Paused · next after 06 and 08</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 7.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 3.5</span><span><b>Match</b> 80.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> the first 10 units are close, apart from smeared water next to Benny when steering. The matched tube stops shortly before the drop into Screen 08; after that the old tube appears, and during the drop a gold band fills the whole screen.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> the matched scenery covers only part of the 07 tube, and the drop itself was never matched.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 07\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"During the drop into 08\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · during the drop into 08</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s05\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><h2 id=\"s05\">Flow Into the Current</h2><span class=\"status\">Paused</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 8.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 6</span><span><b>Match</b> 89.4 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> the approved look holds for about the first 20 units. From about two-thirds of the screen the old, pre-matching Screen 05 world appears (pink walls, orange band, white foam pillars). When steering, the river spreads into one wide sheet, and near coins look very large.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> the matched tunnel, rings and river only cover the stretch around the approved view.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 05\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/05_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/05_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s04\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h2 id=\"s04\">Through the Five Arrows</h2><span class=\"status\">Paused</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 8</span><span><b>Riding</b> 4</span><span><b>Match</b> 81.8 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> from about 6 units forward the gold tunnel turns into a blurred orange smear and the water becomes a flat, narrow ramp with hard straight edges. The blue arrows, pink swirls and foam banks fade out after about 10 units.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> your original pixels are only correct near the approved camera. Further along they are stretched down the tunnel, because there is no tunnel-anchored ring, light-bulb and swirl-water material and no foam-bank geometry beyond that point.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 04\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/04_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/04_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"sfix\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">Fixed</span><h2 id=\"sfix\">Screen 08 in the combined preview</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"fix\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0\">With every screen's test version switched on together, Screen 08 used to fall to 29.5 % because Screen 07's river change pushed the whole 08 path half a unit sideways, out of line with the 08 scenery. That is fixed on the preview test branch: <b>87.7 %</b>. The normal game is unchanged, the coins still total 2,240 and the drop into 08 is intact. This is a test branch, not the release game.</p>\n    <div class=\"strip\">\n      <figure><a href=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 08\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>1 · Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure><a href=\"img/p08_before.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/p08_before.jpg\" alt=\"Before the fix, 29.5 percent\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>2 · Before</b> · all switches · 29.5 %</figcaption></figure>\n      <figure><a href=\"img/p08_after.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/p08_after.jpg\" alt=\"After the fix, 87.7 percent\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>3 · New</b> · all switches · 87.7 %</figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n", "file_path": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-rainbow-/cd1e5cfb-443e-5b5a-b9b8-262d44ab3b8a/scratchpad/report/rainbow_visual_audit.html"}, "name": "Write", "type": "tool_use"}], "context_management": null, "diagnostics": null, "id": "msg_011Ch9GWvxr4a38XzQiuNfqx", "input_transformations": [], "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1305, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1305, "cache_read_input_tokens": 344519, "fallback_credit": null, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "iterations": [{"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1305, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1305, "cache_read_input_tokens": 344519, "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 9194, "type": "message"}], "output_tokens": 9194, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 1193}, "server_tool_use": {"web_fetch_requests": 0, "web_search_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "parentUuid": "fecbd691-870d-450f-8ef2-40eb96595995", "perTurnEffort": "xhigh", "promptCacheRequested": "1h", "requestId": "req_011Ch9GWvjCN1BLSeAYGqPv3", "requestedModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "sessionId": "cd1e5cfb-443e-5b5a-b9b8-262d44ab3b8a", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T22:13:45.252Z", "toolInputStreamMs": 58056, "type": "assistant", "userType": "external", "uuid": "294dcbdc-7b87-44fa-9011-5cf5fe3d137d", "version": "2.1.326", "wireToolInputs": {"toolu_011JNJfKubFNgBHJz52YDU3c": {"content": "<title>Rainbow Screens 04–08 Audit</title>\n<meta name=\"claude:viewport-fit-sides\" content=\"cover\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@600;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\">\n<style>\n/* Layout: one column of screen sections; each section = verdict block + a swipeable strip of full-size portrait frames */\n:root{\n  --bg:#f6f2fb; --panel:#ffffff; --fg:#241a33; --muted:#6b5f7d; --line:#e2d8ef;\n  --gold:#b8770e; --cyan:#0d8fb0; --pink:#c2287a;\n  --ok:#1f8a4c; --warn:#b26a00; --bad:#c0362c;\n  --display:\"Baloo 2\",\"Trebuchet MS\",system-ui,sans-serif; --body:\"Inter\",system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;\n}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme=\"light\"]){\n  --bg:#17111f; --panel:#221a2e; --fg:#f1eaf8; --muted:#b3a6c4; --line:#3a2f4a;\n  --gold:#f2b84b; --cyan:#4fd0ee; --pink:#ff6fb5; --ok:#4cc77f; --warn:#f0a43a; --bad:#ff7466; color-scheme:dark}}\n:root[data-theme=\"dark\"]{\n  --bg:#17111f; --panel:#221a2e; --fg:#f1eaf8; --muted:#b3a6c4; --line:#3a2f4a;\n  --gold:#f2b84b; --cyan:#4fd0ee; --pink:#ff6fb5; --ok:#4cc77f; --warn:#f0a43a; --bad:#ff7466; color-scheme:dark}\nbody{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:15px/1.55 var(--body);\n  padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px));padding-block:20px 48px}\n.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:28px}\nh1,h2{font-family:var(--display);line-height:1.1;text-wrap:balance;margin:0}\nh1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);font-weight:800}\nh2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.6vw,28px);font-weight:800}\n.sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:68ch;margin:6px 0 0}\n.eyebrow{font:600 12px/1 var(--body);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n.summary{display:grid;gap:10px}\n.tbl{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel)}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:560px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\nth,td{padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}\nth{font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}\ntr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}\n.chip{display:inline-block;min-width:2.6em;text-align:center;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;border:1.5px solid currentColor}\n.c-ok{color:var(--ok)} .c-warn{color:var(--warn)} .c-bad{color:var(--bad)}\n.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:80ch;margin:0}\nsection.screen{display:grid;gap:12px;padding-top:22px;border-top:2px solid var(--line)}\n.head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:8px 16px}\n.num{font-family:var(--display);color:var(--gold);font-size:22px;font-weight:800}\n.facts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px;font-size:14px}\n.facts b{font-weight:600}\n.verdict{display:grid;gap:6px;max-width:80ch}\n.verdict p{margin:0}\n.lbl{font-weight:600}\n.status{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan)}\n.strip{display:flex;gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding-bottom:8px;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}\nfigure{margin:0;flex:0 0 min(78vw,360px);scroll-snap-align:start;display:grid;gap:6px}\nfigure a{display:block;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}\nfigure a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cyan);outline-offset:2px}\nfigure img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:9/16;max-width:100%}\nfigcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\nfigcaption b{color:var(--fg);font-weight:600}\n.fix{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;display:grid;gap:10px}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<header>\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\">Rainbow · playable screens 04–08 · 17 Nov 2026</div>\n  <h1>Visual audit while Benny swims</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">Each screen's newest version, compared with your approved image at the approved camera and while moving\n  forward, steering and later in the screen. Swipe each row; tap a picture to open it full size. Nothing here is approved —\n  only you approve.</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"summary\">\n  <div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n    <thead><tr><th>Screen</th><th>Approved view<br>(my rating)</th><th>While riding<br>(my rating)</th><th>Whole-frame match<br>at approved view</th><th>Colour match<br>while moving</th><th>Normal game today</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>04 Through the Five Arrows</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">4</span></td><td>81.8 %</td><td>67.9 %</td><td>6.4 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>05 Flow Into the Current</td><td><span class=\"chip c-ok\">8.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">6</span></td><td>89.4 %</td><td>79.3 %</td><td>18.5 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>06 Crest the Rinse Arch</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">3</span></td><td>79.1 %</td><td>67.7 %</td><td>5.0 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>07 Dive the Washer Tube</td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-bad\">3.5</span></td><td>80.1 %</td><td>65.6 %</td><td>6.7 %</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>08 Final Spin Chamber</td><td><span class=\"chip c-ok\">8.5</span></td><td><span class=\"chip c-warn\">7</span></td><td>84.1 %</td><td>76.2 %</td><td>4.0 %</td></tr>\n    </tbody></table></div>\n  <p class=\"note\"><b>No screen reaches your 8.5/10 target while riding yet.</b> Ratings are my visual judgement. \"Whole-frame match\" =\n  share of pixels within 20 colour levels of your image (includes Benny and the top bar). \"Colour match while moving\" = how\n  much of your image's colour palette survives in 11 moving frames (your approved view scores 91–96 %; the normal game\n  42–59 %). Neither number proves a moving 3D scene looks identical.</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s08\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">08</span><h2 id=\"s08\">Final Spin Chamber</h2><span class=\"status\">Specialist working now</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 8.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 7</span><span><b>Match</b> 84.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> the chamber holds up well while swimming forward. Gold arch slivers slide in at the edges when steering, and steering hard puts Benny on the purple floor beside the painted river (it also costs a heart near the end).</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> chamber surfaces your painting never showed, and river texture only on the painted S-curve instead of under the whole swim lane.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\">These frames are missing the ceiling fix from last round: its code had been dropped from the saved branch by an autosave and was restored this round from history.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 08\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/08_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/08_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s06\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><h2 id=\"s06\">Crest the Rinse Arch</h2><span class=\"status\">Specialist working now · your major priority</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 7.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 3</span><span><b>Match</b> 79.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> from 3 units forward a huge flat wall of repeated pink-chevron water fills most of the screen; the curved tunnel survives only above a hard horizontal edge.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> the fitted river surface is much wider than your painted river and rises as a hump. From the approved camera it carries your painted tunnel walls, so it looks right; once Benny moves, those wall areas switch to one repeated, mirrored water tile.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 06\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_s_left_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_s_left_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering left\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering left</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_s_right_steer.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_s_right_steer.jpg\" alt=\"Steering right\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Steering right</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/06_t66_through_screen.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/06_t66_through_screen.jpg\" alt=\"Two thirds through\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Later</b> · ⅔ through the screen</figcaption></figure>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"screen\" aria-labelledby=\"s07\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">07</span><h2 id=\"s07\">Dive the Washer Tube</h2><span class=\"status\">Paused · next after 06 and 08</span></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\"><span><b>Approved view</b> 7.5</span><span><b>Riding</b> 3.5</span><span><b>Match</b> 80.1 %</span></div>\n  <div class=\"verdict\">\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">What breaks:</span> the first 10 units are close, apart from smeared water next to Benny when steering. The matched tube stops shortly before the drop into Screen 08; after that the old tube appears, and during the drop a gold band fills the whole screen.</p>\n    <p><span class=\"lbl\">Why:</span> the matched scenery covers only part of the 07 tube, and the drop itself was never matched.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_approved.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_approved.jpg\" alt=\"Approved Screen 07\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Approved original</b></figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_now.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_now.jpg\" alt=\"Game at the approved view\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Game now</b> · same camera</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/07_f06_forward6u.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"img/07_f06_forward6u.jpg\" alt=\"Forward 6 units\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption><b>Forward</b> · 6 units</figcaption></figure>\n    <figure><a href=\"img/0